SUMMARY:2026 West Palm SBK Festival - 10% Discount
DESCRIPTION:Use promo code GOLD26 to save 10% on your pass!\nGET READY FOR MEMORIAL DAY WEEKEND 2026.. !!! \nGet ready for the BIGGEST & Most Fun Dance Weekend with 4 Days of Non-Stop Partying! Over 25 Master Dance Workshops on Salsa\, Bachata\, Kizomba\, Cha-Cha-Cha & Mambo + Spectacular World Dance Champions & Pro-Am Dance Performances – Kids Dance Competitions\, Pool Parties – 4 Nights Dance Social -Saturday Dinner Banquet – FREE PARKING – Cash Bar Plus More… \nThe Hottest Salsa Bachata Kizomba Dance Festival in Palm Beach County. Get ready today… !!!! \nEVENT SCHEDULED \nTHURDAY MAY 21 –\nPRE PARTY @ 9:00 PM \nFRIDAY – MAY 22\nDance Workshops 11:00am to 5:00pm\nDance Showcases 8:00pm\nDance Social 10:00pm to 4:00am \nSATURDAY -MAY 23\nDance Workshops 10:00am to 5:00pm\nPool Party 2:00pm\nDance Showcases 8:00pm\nDance Social 10:00pm to 4:00am \nSUNDAY – MAY 24\nDance Workshops 10:00am to 5:00pm\nOfficial pool party – 2:00pm\nDance Showcases 8:00pm\nDance Social 10:00pm to 2:00am \nPlease note – Time and Scheule are subject to change. I.D must be present at Registration Desk\, Tickets are NOT REFUNDABLE – However tickets Purchased before Event Start Date are Transferable for free. \nLOCATION\nHilton Palm Beach Airport\n150 Australian Ave West Palm Beach 33406 \nWest Palm SBK Fest \nBuy tickets \nhttps://buytickets.at/westpalmsbkfest/1716979 \nHilton Palm Beach Airport\n150 Australian Ave West Palm Beach FL \n$149.00 HOTEL ROOMS DISCOUNT LINK BELOW \nhttps://www.hilton.com/en/book/reservation/deeplink/?ctyhocn=PBIAHHF&groupCode=SBK26&arrivaldate=2026-05-21&departuredate=2026-05-25&cid=OM\,WW\,HILTONLINK\,EN\,DirectLink&fromId=HILTONLINKDIRECT \nRESERVE TODAY DONT DELAY……..!!!!! \nLet’s Dance…🕺💃
URL:https://golatindance.com/event/west-palm-sbk-fest-2026/
LOCATION:Hilton Palm Beach Airport (West Palm Beach\, FL)\, 150 Australian Ave\, West Palm Beach\, FL\, United States
CATEGORIES:Miami
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golatindance.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/607583934_1462040602433872_6760721112212050865_n.jpg
END:VEVENT
